OpenJarvis Voice Kit

This project is an unofficial add-on for OpenJarvis
(https://github.com/open-jarvis/OpenJarvis), which is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. A copy of that licence is in the LICENSE file.

patches/voice-kit.patch changes these OpenJarvis files:

- src/openjarvis/connectors/oauth.py: Gmail and Calendar access is read-only.
- src/openjarvis/cli/connect_cmd.py: pasted secrets and tokens stay hidden.
- src/openjarvis/cli/chat_cmd.py: adds voice commands, web search and answers
  from calendar and email.
- src/openjarvis/system/core.py: Telegram questions can use calendar and email.

The patch also adds these new files:

- src/openjarvis/cli/_my_day.py
- src/openjarvis/cli/_open_app.py
- src/openjarvis/cli/_web_answer.py

"Jarvis" is only the assistant's name here. This project is not affiliated with
or endorsed by the OpenJarvis team, Marvel, Google, YouTube, Spotify, Telegram
or anyone else mentioned.
